"Hesra lost her apprentice to winter fever and wants a quick pair of hands before the lambing ends."
"Hesra would take any woman with quick hands and a strong stomach as apprentice, stranger or not."
"Hesra once studied a season with Qira as a girl, and the two quarrelled over gods ever since."
"Hesra knows Wenna Ashlar's elder son is up at the watchtower, and has kept it to herself."
